menu "Device identity"

    config IDENTITY_SOFTAP_SSID_PREFIX
        string "SoftAP SSID prefix"
        default "TDS3-"
        help
            The provisioning SoftAP is named this prefix followed by the last
            three base-MAC bytes in upper-case hex (FSD FR-13.1). Prefix and
            hex together are cut to 15 characters.

    config IDENTITY_HOSTNAME_PREFIX
        string "Hostname prefix"
        default "tds3-"
        help
            The DHCP and mDNS hostname is this prefix followed by the same
            three bytes in lower-case hex (FSD FR-20.1). Use only letters,
            digits and '-'. Prefix and hex together are cut to 15 characters.

endmenu
